# OKD / OpenShift deployment package

Generated by AthanorIDE for `{{ project_name }}`.

Each namespace under `deploy/okd/{namespace}/` is a **kustomize** root with:

- Namespace, ConfigMap, Secret placeholders (keys only)
- Deployment, Service, NetworkPolicy
- Route (edge TLS)
- ImageStream + BuildConfig (builds from the repo `Containerfile`)

## Apply

```bash
{% if deployment.primary_target %}
# Primary environment
oc apply -k deploy/okd/{{ deployment.primary_target.namespace }}/
{% else %}
# No primary target — apply each namespace folder
for dir in deploy/okd/*/; do oc apply -k "$dir"; done
{% endif %}
```

Or apply every OKD target:

```bash
for dir in deploy/okd/*/; do
  oc apply -k "$dir"
done
```

## Image

Prefer building locally with Podman (`./deploy/podman/build.sh`) and pushing to your registry,
then set the Deployment image — or use the generated BuildConfig after setting `source.git.uri`.

The Deployment uses non-root `securityContext` settings compatible with restricted SCC profiles.
Secret **values are never exported**; inject them out-of-band.
